# Build context filter for dev.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
#
# CLAUDE.md is a symlink to AGENTS.md created on Linux. Docker Desktop on Windows
# reads the context through \\wsl.localhost and cannot follow those links, so the
# build aborts with: failed to solve: invalid file request mem0/CLAUDE.md.
# They are documentation aliases and are never needed inside the image.
**/CLAUDE.md
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
